msgctxt "128"
msgid "I'm real sorry about what I said, Uncle Kaz."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Me too."
msgstr "Anch'io."

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"It's okay. Just remember we all need to stick together.\r\n"
"Everyone here is part of the same family, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Okay... Oh, and did Shiro say anything?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Not yet. I'm still trying to figure it all out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"Hey, something's up with Shiro. You two know if anything\r\n"
"happened at school?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "I don't. We barely even see each other most days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "What about you, Riona?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"Same. He's in a way lower grade than me, so our classes are\r\n"
"really far away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Sorry."
msgstr "Scusa."

msgctxt "248"
msgid "It's all right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Want me to figure out what's wrong, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "How are you gonna do that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"Easy, I'll just put him in a headlock! That'll get him\r\n"
"talkin' in no time, haha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Hey, that's a good idea! I bet I could take him, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Come on, you two."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"You should be looking out for Shiro, not trying to beat\r\n"
"him up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"That's what being an older sibling is all about. I thought\r\n"
"you knew better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Never mind, I'll do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"And keep your hands to yourself, Koji. You're just gonna\r\n"
"make things worse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "All right..."
msgstr "Va bene..."

msgctxt "416"
msgid "Are you sure you haven't seen Shiro?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "You know that girl Takako?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah! She's so snobby, like she thinks she's better\r\n"
"than all of us! Kinda crazy for a third-grader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "(...They're not paying attention to me.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Koji, have you seen Shiro around?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "Ummm, nope!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "What about you, Riona?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "I haven't seen him either. Maybe he's off playing somewhere?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Anyway, this boy in my class, Okada-kun..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5196"
msgid "Koji"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5200"
msgid "Riona"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5204"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""

